mt-swiper

wmwy.js is a JavaScript translation of the following files of

  Phyrion, omega-Y-Well-Ordering-Lean
  https://github.com/Phyrion1343/omega-Y-Well-Ordering-Lean
  revision 33c16a8ce8f7e01bb3794881f3ff9109474beaed

    OmegaY/Rows.lean              (jump, bump, B and the row order)
    OmegaY/Canonical/Build.lean   (the mountain, `build`)
    OmegaY/Expansion/Build.lean   (the expansion, `expand`)

which are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE).
The translation was made by koteitan in 2026 from the copies of these files in
https://github.com/koteitan/wmwy-wo-por (unchanged apart from a header line).
Changes: translated from Lean 4 to JavaScript; the Lean error values are thrown
as exceptions; a row is an array of coefficients; the proofs are not
translated; `badRoot` is added for the display. wmwy.js itself is distributed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
